<% content_for :title, "Age Calculator — whizwheel" %>

<%#
  Age calculator page (spec issue #82, DESIGN.md BLEND) — the project's first date-math
  calculator. Two plain date fields and NO mode picker (the spec's `multi-mode` tag is
  about the multiple OUTPUT representations, not an input selector — so no Mode-picker
  component applies, DESIGN.md §4): a required date of birth and an optional end date
  ("age at the date of") that defaults to today server-side when left blank.

  The form posts over Turbo and re-renders the #result region in place; it works WITHOUT
  JS (the server validates the dates and fills today). Native <input type="date"> gives
  every browser its own date picker — no client framework, consistent with the importmap
  ethos (DESIGN.md §0 progressive enhancement). Layout per DESIGN.md §3 — an input column
  + a results panel (≈380px 1fr), collapsing to one column on mobile.

  The optional end date ("Age at the date of") carries a "Today" quick-fill button
  (DESIGN.md §4 "Date field with Today quick-fill"), wired by the age_controller as pure
  enhancement: tapping it fills the current date. The field is NEVER auto-prefilled —
  blank stays blank, and the server defaults a blank end date to today, so the "today"
  default is visible and chosen, not hidden. The REQUIRED date of birth gets no quick-fill
  and is never auto-defaulted (DESIGN.md §4 — a primary date carries no "today" meaning).

  Spacing scale (DESIGN.md §3, "targets not minimums"):
    • stacked fields → space-y-5
    • the date field ↔ its "Today" affordance → Affix tier (gap-2)
    • the field block → submit (major blocks) → mt-8 (Section tier)
    • column gutters / card padding → gap-8 / p-7–p-8 (Layout tier)
%>

<header class="max-w-2xl">
  <p class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-accent">Other</p>
  <h1 class="mt-2 text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-[-0.035em] text-ink">Age Calculator</h1>
  <p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted">
    Your exact age between two dates — a years, months and days breakdown plus the same span
    in total months, weeks, days and hours. Leave the second date blank to measure to today.
    Every answer is computed server-side.
  </p>
</header>

<div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[380px_1fr]">
  <%# ── Input column ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── %>
  <section class="rounded-[18px] border border-border bg-surface p-7 shadow-[0_10px_34px_rgba(150,110,80,0.12)] sm:p-8">
    <%= form_with url: "/calculators/age", scope: :inputs, method: :post,
          data: { controller: "age" } do |f| %>

      <%# Two native date fields, stacked (DESIGN.md §3 Stacked tier: space-y-5). Each has
          a real <label> (DESIGN.md §6). type="date" gives the browser's own picker; the
          .field-input vocabulary keeps them visually identical to the numeric inputs on
          the other pages so the system stays coherent. %>
      <div class="space-y-5">
        <%# Date of birth — REQUIRED, no quick-fill: a birth date carries no "today"
            meaning and must be entered (DESIGN.md §4). Never auto-defaulted. %>
        <div>
          <%= f.label :birth_date, "Date of birth", class: "field-label", for: "inputs_birth_date" %>
          <%= f.date_field :birth_date, id: "inputs_birth_date", class: "field-input mt-1.5" %>
        </div>

        <%# Age at the date of — OPTIONAL: blank means "today". The date input sits beside
            an explicit "Today" quick-fill button on the Affix tier (gap-2, DESIGN.md §3) —
            tapping it fills today (age_controller). Never auto-prefilled; the server fills
            today when this stays blank (DESIGN.md §4 "Date field with Today quick-fill"). %>
        <div>
          <%= f.label :end_date, "Age at the date of", class: "field-label", for: "inputs_end_date" %>
          <div class="mt-1.5 flex items-center gap-2">
            <%= f.date_field :end_date, id: "inputs_end_date", class: "field-input",
                  data: { age_target: "endDate" } %>
            <button type="button" class="today-button" data-action="age#today">Today</button>
          </div>
          <%# The optional-field cue: end_date defaults to today server-side when omitted.
              States the default in words so it never relies on placeholder behaviour. %>
          <p class="mt-1.5 text-xs text-muted">Optional — defaults to today.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <%# Submit — Section tier above; primary coral button (DESIGN.md §4). %>
      <%= f.submit "Calculate age",
            class: "mt-8 w-full cursor-pointer rounded-[13px] bg-primary px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-surface shadow-sm transition-opacity hover:opacity-90 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent" %>
    <% end %>
  </section>

  <%# ── Results panel (the Turbo target) ─────────────────────────────────── %>
  <section id="result" aria-live="polite">
    <%= render "calculators/result", calc: nil %>
  </section>
</div>
